<title>LATVIA: Latvia consumer prices rise 1.2 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Latvia consumer prices rise 1.2 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian consumer prices rose 1.2 percent in October compared with 0.7-percent growth in September for a year-on-year increase of 15.7 percent, the country's statistics department reported on Monday.</p>
<p>					  Oct 96     Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month inflation (PCT)   +1.2	+0.7	  +1.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year inflation (PCT)    +15.7     +16.2	 +24.0</p>
<p>Index-N/A</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371-721 52 40</p>
</text>
